00:30:00.000 --> 00:30:01.876
First, a search relevance workbench,
a systematic framework for evaluating and tuning search relevance.

00:30:02.276 --> 00:30:08.396
As our corpus grows and user needs evolve,
we need automated ways to measure and improve quality.

00:30:09.556 --> 00:30:14.596
Second, unified analytics, visual data transformation,
and pipelines for legal data processing.

00:30:14.956 --> 00:30:20.276
This will make our ingestion pipeline
more accessible and easier to maintain.

00:30:21.276 --> 00:30:28.036
Third, additional agent tools, specifically
summarization and legal principle extraction as new NCP tools.

00:30:28.316 --> 00:30:30.516
Remember the composability principle?

00:30:30.516 --> 00:30:35.356
Every new capability we build becomes a tool that an agent can use.

00:30:35.836 --> 00:30:42.756
And fourth, an agent evaluation framework
objectively measures of agent accuracy and performance.

00:30:42.956 --> 00:30:48.036
This is critical for moving the research
agent from proof of concept to production.

00:30:48.396 --> 00:30:54.996
We need to be able to quantify how well the agent
performs across different types of legal research tasks.

00:31:00.236 --> 00:31:03.436
Let me leave you with five key takeaways from our journey.

00:31:04.716 --> 00:31:10.876
Start with a strong foundation. Hybrid search combined
with fine tuned models delivers production grade legal search.

00:31:10.916 --> 00:31:12.556
Don't skip the fundamentals.

00:31:13.716 --> 00:31:18.596
Measure and iterate. SageMaker Unified Studio
enables data driven product improvement.

00:31:18.636 --> 00:31:21.436
You can't improve what you can't measure.

00:31:22.756 --> 00:31:29.476
Go. Agentic Bedrock AgentCore lets you compose
existing AI products into intelligent assistance,

00:31:29.476 --> 00:31:33.356
but only do this once your individual components are solid.

00:31:34.716 --> 00:31:39.716
Responsible AI matters, especially
in high stakes domains like law. Bedrock.

00:31:39.716 --> 00:31:48.516
Guardrails ensures trustworthy outputs build
trust from day one and finally build composable.

00:31:48.556 --> 00:31:52.836
Every AI capability you build should be designed as a reusable tool.

00:31:53.316 --> 00:31:59.596
This is what enables you to move from individual
features to intelligent agents without starting over.

00:32:00.716 --> 00:32:03.716
These principles aren't specific to just legal search.

00:32:03.716 --> 00:32:08.636
They apply to any domain where you're building
AI powered search and research systems.

00:32:10.756 --> 00:32:14.156
For those in the live stream, thank you for joining us online.

00:32:14.156 --> 00:32:16.796
For those here, thank you all for joining us today.

00:32:16.796 --> 00:32:20.476
We hope this gave you practical
insights into how you can apply your own AI

00:32:20.476 --> 00:32:24.716
and data initiatives to improve
the quality of our future summit events,

00:32:24.716 --> 00:32:28.156
